        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Embroidered silk waistcoat, made in Italy, ca. 1800"@en , "Waistcoat of cream striped silk, embroidered with chenille in a floral pattern. Buttons are self covered with a central embroidered chenille star pattern. It is lined and backed with linen and faced with silk. There are two sets of tape ties for adjustment at the back."@en ;
